# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) and this package divide the work rather than overlap, along a single line:\n"
msgstr "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) والحزمة دي بيقسموا الشغل بدل ما يتداخلوا، على خط واحد:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| ffsim owns                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | `qiskit-fermions` owns                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| The high-level ansatz *operators* ([`UCJOpSpinBalanced`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced \"(in ffsim)\"), [`UCCSDOpRestrictedReal`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal.html#ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal \"(in ffsim)\") and their siblings), built from coupled-cluster amplitudes or a parameter vector | The fermionic *circuit* ([`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")) those operators become, and its transpilation into a qubit circuit under any fermion-to-qubit encoding |\n"
"| Fast simulation in a compact fixed-particle-number space                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | The mapper framework and the operator data structures the circuit is built from                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ffsim بتمتلك | `qiskit-fermions` بتمتلك |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| *مُشغّلات* الـ ansatz عالية المستوى ([`UCJOpSpinBalanced`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced \"(in ffsim)\")، [`UCCSDOpRestrictedReal`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal.html#ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal \"(in ffsim)\") وأخواتهم)، المبنية من سعات coupled-cluster أو متجه معاملات | *الدائرة* الفرميونية ([`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")) اللي المُشغّلات دي بتتحول ليها، وترجمتها لدائرة كيوبتات تحت أي ترميز فرميون-لكيوبت |\n"
"| محاكاة سريعة في فضاء مدمج بعدد جسيمات ثابت | إطار الـ mapper وهياكل بيانات المُشغّلات اللي الدائرة بتتبني منها |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The practical consequence runs both ways. The ansatz math lives in ffsim, so [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") and [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") take an ffsim operator directly as their input. Conversely, ffsim’s own Qiskit gates are specific to the Jordan-Wigner transformation, so lowering one of its ansatz operators through a *different* encoding is what bringing it here buys you.\n"
msgstr "النتيجة العملية بتمشي في الاتجاهين. رياضيات الـ ansatz موجودة في ffsim، فـ [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") و[`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") بياخدوا مُشغّل ffsim مباشرةً كمدخل. وبالعكس، بوابات Qiskit الخاصة بـ ffsim مخصصة لتحويل Jordan-Wigner، فخفض واحد من مُشغّلات الـ ansatz بتاعتها عبر ترميز *مختلف* هو اللي بيجيبه لك الجيب هنا.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulation is where the two meet, and this guide explains how. ffsim is this package’s simulation backend, reached through its own protocols rather than a wrapper: the [SKQD guide](skqd#skqd-getting-started) calls [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\"), [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\"), and [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") directly on [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")objects and [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\")objects, with no conversion step.\n"
msgstr "المحاكاة هي المكان اللي الاتنين بيتقابلوا فيه، والدليل ده بيشرح إزاي. ffsim هي الـ backend بتاع المحاكاة في الحزمة دي، بيتوصل ليها عبر بروتوكولاتها الخاصة مش عبر wrapper: [دليل SKQD](skqd#skqd-getting-started) بيستدعي [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\")، [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\")، و[`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") مباشرةً على كائنات [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")وكائنات [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\")، من غير خطوة تحويل.\n"

